WEBVTT

00:14:28.407 --> 00:14:30.182
Stvorili smo državne penzije

00:14:30.182 --> 00:14:32.207
i sindikate.

00:14:32.207 --> 00:14:34.723
Danas živimo u eri

00:14:34.723 --> 00:14:36.684
ekonomske transformacije

00:14:36.684 --> 00:14:39.990
uporedive u stepenu i obimu

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:42.258
sa industrijskom revolucijom.

00:14:42.258 --> 00:14:45.449
Da bismo bili sigurni da ova
nova ekonomija koristi svima,

00:14:45.449 --> 00:14:47.567
a ne samo plutokratama,

00:14:47.567 --> 00:14:49.231
morali bismo kročiti u eru

00:14:49.231 --> 00:14:53.150
podjednako ambicioznih
društvenih i političkih promena.

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.808
Potreban nam je novi Nju Dil.

00:14:55.808 --> 00:14:59.808
(Aplauz)